  — the measurement limit (Zurek 1981/82, the exactly solvable einselection model) — with
  the environment in the diagonal state `ω = diag w`.  Proved here, axiom-free:

  • THE DYNAMICS — `intPhase` is the diagonal phase unitary `U_t = e^{−itH_int}` (defined
